{"4170790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Fridge", "steam_appid": 4170790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruits as enemies with different mechanics that will keep the tension high, force you to move quickly, and constantly make you question your positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps with rooms of various shapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run you’ll be able to buy or find different weapons — equip different combinations and experiment with various synergies..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests and obtain different magical catalysts from them to enhance your weapons’ damage, and with some luck you may even find weapons inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.poster.avif?t=1767640665\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.webm?t=1767640665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.mp4?t=1767640665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fruits as enemies with different mechanics that will keep the tension high, force you to move quickly, and constantly make you question your positioning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps with rooms of various shapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each run you’ll be able to buy or find different weapons — equip different combinations and experiment with various synergies..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find chests and obtain different magical catalysts from them to enhance your weapons’ damage, and with some luck you may even find weapons inside.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.poster.avif?t=1767640665\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.webm?t=1767640665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/extras/653850084efd89bc015375332a81cc45.mp4?t=1767640665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "THE FRIDGE is an action-roguelite with procedurally generated maps. Find or purchase weapons in each run and face increasingly challenging waves of enemies. Obtain magical catalysts to boost your weapons’ power and experiment with different combinations to adapt your combat style.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/c4dd2cbac9f9657f645582534b3b0b6f1c11a7ae/header.jpg?t=1767640665", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/2e803e5698496c377a7bb597072cb9e654cd3fbb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767640665", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170790/2e803e5698496c377a7bb597072cb9e654cd3fbb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767640665", 